{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Hey Gina! I'm turning my loves of dance into a business. I'm sunk tons of time into the studio lately, and look at my students - they're already killing it. I'm even learning with them!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-c81f716ac43d38c5bfe1cd7f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:29:44.224343+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c81f716ac43d38c5bfe1cd7f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c81f716ac43d38c5bfe1cd7f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Hey Jon! Wow, way to take your passion and make it into a biz! The dance studio looks awesome."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-0a0004c6b17401e002f287bf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:29:48.329394+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0a0004c6b17401e002f287bf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0a0004c6b17401e002f287bf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks, Gina! I'm determined to make this studio work. Losing my job was tough but it gave me the push I needed to do what I love."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-2aecb6c929aeb4579d7b2474", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:29:52.402509+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2aecb6c929aeb4579d7b2474", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2aecb6c929aeb4579d7b2474", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Woah, Jon! Tough times can be a gateway to awesome things. Glad you worked up the courage to go after your dreams!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-adb405465d622a09c4efa969", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:29:56.485889+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "adb405465d622a09c4efa969", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "adb405465d622a09c4efa969", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Yeah, Gina! It's been tough, but I'm living my true self. Dancing makes me so happy, and now I get to share that with other people. Seeing my students get better at it brings me such joy."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-433ba9fcac2a39bcd7565286", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:30:00.611700+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "433ba9fcac2a39bcd7565286", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "433ba9fcac2a39bcd7565286", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Wow Jon, you look so happy when you dance! Show the world your true self and keep dancing!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-c4752395139cb42a06322c90", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:30:04.702947+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c4752395139cb42a06322c90", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c4752395139cb42a06322c90", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks a bunch, Gina! You seriously rock. Dancing for me is like a way to express myself and find my happy place. I used to be scared to death of what people would think, but I learnt that my own happiness is the most important thing. It's been tough but also the best thing ever!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-c4dab423599bb80d6d4da65b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:30:08.797115+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c4dab423599bb80d6d4da65b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c4dab423599bb80d6d4da65b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Yeah, I do remember those dance classes! I used to love spending time in the studio. That photo looks awesome, brings back lots of memories. It's nice to know, dance is still your happy place."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-28b1360821cb3f955b85365f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:30:12.879213+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "28b1360821cb3f955b85365f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "28b1360821cb3f955b85365f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Nice, Gina! I'm happy that dance has such a special meaning to both of us. It's a really cool way to express ourselves. I loved taking lessons with my friends when I was younger. Those memories are so precious. So glad I can still enjoy it with my own studio. Thanks for always being there for me."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-22f6f492f8c51117f8c212db", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:30:16.972104+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "22f6f492f8c51117f8c212db", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "22f6f492f8c51117f8c212db", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Hey Jon! Got your back - dance is awesome for expressing yourself and finding happiness. Here's one of my trophies from a dance contest, nice reminder of the hard work, dedication and joy it brings."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-e7de96a96313e400801274f6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:30:21.089709+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e7de96a96313e400801274f6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e7de96a96313e400801274f6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Wow! It looks awesome! Thanks for the support, it really means a lot."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-41578f20344b6b1d48bfd242", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:30:25.186449+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "41578f20344b6b1d48bfd242", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "41578f20344b6b1d48bfd242", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: No prob, Jon! You earned all the kudos for your hard work. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-40eedabe2ec67a82975161fe", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:30:29.341071+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "40eedabe2ec67a82975161fe", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "40eedabe2ec67a82975161fe", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! Gonna keep pushing and working hard. Won't let anything hold me back!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-5c44b91f59edf100d0b3fa6c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:30:33.430574+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5c44b91f59edf100d0b3fa6c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5c44b91f59edf100d0b3fa6c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Way to go, Jon! Keep it up, you're almost there!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-30/session_9-35123d24949bd61ff1f31a44", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:30:37.547511+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "35123d24949bd61ff1f31a44", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "35123d24949bd61ff1f31a44", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
